WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.980
*quiet clicking*

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:02.600
*something hits something wooden*

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.740
*we wake up with a slight snort*

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:05.120
*the tv is making quiet static noises*

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.240
*thuds as we reach and try to find our flashlight*

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:08.140
*click*

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.640
*we're breathing a little loudly, scared*

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.700
*faint, deep voice* Do you remember?

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:14.700
*indistinct voice*

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
I said...

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:26.140
...we were going to do great things together.

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:27.060
*ray gun noises*

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.960
*shaking the ray gun*

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:32.480
*its not really a ray gun, I know*

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:33.940
*more indistinct voice*

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:35.160
*soft horror music plays in the background*

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.860
*it starts at a slow tempo but speeds up*

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:38.200
*more voices*

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:40.780
*we throw the broken(?) ray gun away*

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:44.340
Go back to sleep.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:45.080
*horror music stops*

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:45.580
*click*

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:04.740
*click*

